><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">MISSING MILES</span><!----></h2><!----><!----><div><app-jss-count-down-timer><!----></app-jss-count-down-timer></div><!----></div><div class=\"cms-img-container\"><div class=\"desktop-view ng-star-inserted\"><img src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/SXAPages/loyalty-program/about-alfursan-program/alfursan-miles/missing-miles/missing-miles.ashx?h=350&amp;iar=0&amp;w=1920&amp;rev=a78ce7c792a1477591bb153909fd1e35&amp;hash=733011DD456D19357B6303B7F5871648\" alt=\"MISSING MILES\"><div class=\"image-gradient\" id=\"8394729c-d5c3-4f8d-b15c-a7c869cf94eb\"></div></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----></section></app-jss-image><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text-button class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-title-text-button-container ng-star-inserted\"><!----><p appaddtextlimit=\"\" class=\"description ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div>\n<h2>\nMISSING MILES\n</h2>\n<p>\nTo ensure that your Rewards Miles and Tier Credits are credited to your Alfursan account,\nplease make sure to register your Alfursan membership number when booking on Saudia,\nSky Team partner flights or using any of Alfursan commercial partner services.\n</p>\n<h3>\nYou Can Also Easily Claim Missing Miles:\n</h3>\n<h3>\nFirst: Retro claim on \"Saudia\", \"Sky Team\" Flights:\n</h3>\n<ul>\n    <li>Login to Alfursan online.</li>\n    <li>Select \"Retro Claims\"</li>\n    <li>Choose \"Add request\"</li>\n    <li>Fill in the required information</li>\n    <li>You will receive a confirmation by email.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n* Retro Claims for missing miles on Saudia flights must be submitted within a maximum of\n360 days from your travel date.\n</p>\n<p>\n* Retro Claims for missing miles on Sky Team flights must be submitted within a maximum of\n180 days from your travel date.\n</p>\n<h3>\nSecond: Claiming missing Miles on Alfursan commercial partners :\n</h3>\n<p>\nFor Alfursan commercial partners missing Miles, please contact the partner.\n</p>\n<p>\n* Retro Claims for missing miles with Alfursan commercial partners must be submitted within\na maximum of 180 days from your transaction date.\n</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"box-content-wrapper section-top\">\n<section class=\"custom-content__section section-sub\">\n<h3>How to claim missing Miles</h3>\n<div class=\"video-box\">\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IuhDbQKurtk?si=Emg1iynBc0TSIFAM\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"></iframe>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div></span><!----></p><!----><!----><div class=\"link--text\"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text-button><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}